graph TD
    A[Resource Requester: Submits Request] --> B{Capacity Check: Available?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Approval Workflow: Initiate]
    B -- No --> D[Request Denied: Insufficient Capacity]
    C --> E{Manager Approval Needed?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Manager: Review & Approve/Reject]
    F -- Approve --> G[Security Review: Verify Permissions]
    F -- Reject --> H[Request Denied: Manager Rejection]
    G -- Pass --> I[Provisioning System: Create Resources]
    G -- Fail --> J[Request Denied: Security Violation]
    I --> K[Resource Allocation: System Configured]
    K --> L[Notification: Request Fulfilled]
    E -- No --> G
    classDef denied fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    class D,H,J denied